# Git Push & Commit Gate

- NEVER run `git commit`, `git push`, or create PRs unless the user explicitly says the codeword **lion**.
- Local edits, staging (`git add`), and other non-commit git commands are fine.
- If asked to commit or push without **lion**, remind them of the codeword and wait.
